                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">General Lee to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mobs, led by Spanish officers, attacked to-day the offices of the four newspapers
                    here advocating autonomy. Rioting at this hour, 1 p.m., continues.</p>



